 "Every form gives a transitively reduced acyclic graph on 1, \[Ellipsis], ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " with every edge going up in the numbering."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9b541fad-fda0-4e32-9548-7d207e78fef0"],

